* {{hyphenation|quan|ti|za|tion|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{label|en|uncountable|signal processing}} The [[process]] of [[approximating]] a [[continuous]] [[signal]] by a [[set]] of [[discrete]] [[symbol]]s or [[integer]] [[value]]s.
# {{label|en|countable|physics}} A [[procedure]] for [[constructing]] a [[quantum field theory]] starting from a [[classical field theory]].

